{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>《玫瑰戰爭》最新劇情迎來高潮，劇中傅嘉莉驚覺丈夫陳展鵬與陳楨怡發生婚外情，雙方隨即爆發激烈衝突。面對妻子的連番質問，男方不但沒有退縮，反而將矛頭直指她與另一男星之間存在不可告人秘密。隨後女方更被直擊崩潰痛哭倒在對方懷中，讓這段豪門婚姻背後隱藏巨大謎團。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉《玫瑰戰爭》捉姦爆發激烈爭執</h2>\n<p>根據《玫瑰戰爭》第5集預告畫面，由傅嘉莉飾演梁菲雅終於發現殘酷真相，得知丈夫與陳楨怡在外面偷偷出軌。兩夫妻在室內隨即上演一場火藥味十足大鬥法，雙方情緒徹底失控並互相咆哮。這場對質戲碼展現出極強張力，劇情直接將夫妻之間信任危機推向最高點。</p>\n<h2>陳展鵬反擊大爆妻子與馬國明非比尋常</h2>\n<p>在這場激烈對峙之中，面對妻子聲嘶力竭連番指控，陳展鵬飾演丈夫竟然毫不示弱，更冷笑反唇相譏：「你結咗婚之後，你冇同其他男人過夜？」傅嘉莉起初神情堅定並斬釘截鐵否認指控，豈料男方隨即拋出一句「咁德龍呢」，直接點名道姓質疑她與馬國明飾演李德龍關係極度曖昧。</p>\n<h2>梁菲雅伏在李德龍懷中痛哭畫面終流出</h2>\n<p>原本看似理直氣壯，卻因為這句反問陷入被動局面。緊接著預告畫面出現驚人反轉，鏡頭一轉赫然見到傅嘉莉整個人崩潰倒在馬國明懷裡痛哭流涕。兩人不但雙手緊緊交握，女方更主動俯身壓向男方，預告畫面最後更定格在兩人超越普通朋友親密互動之上。</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰戰爭》第五集完整預告：</h2>\n<p>《玫瑰》試戲場上，無雙、綺雲演技火花四濺，雲生拍板由綺雲擔任女主角……菲雅遭永康訓斥沒好好維繫與家俊的夫妻關係，菲雅敢怒不敢言。無雙使計刺激菲雅的演戲欲，令她考慮接拍《玫瑰》。寶兒向德龍透露自己獲邀請加入天誠，心情忐忑，德龍向她訴說「朋友」的經歷。德龍本獲安排參演《玫瑰》，卻被雲生抽起。家俊因為菲雅故意在素希面前宣示主權，與菲雅大吵一場。酒醉的菲雅往找德龍；另邊廂，素希偷拍與家俊的親密照。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447577189194435_14903452346af586fc5df33.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"11123.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447577189194435_14903452346af586fc5df33.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>與丈夫大吵一場後，傅嘉莉酒醉往找馬國明，更伏在對方懷中痛哭。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447577932719916_9620192596af58703af3fb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"11121.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447577932719916_9620192596af58703af3fb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>最後突然爆喊！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447575639441824_19737929616af586ecbff6d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447575639441824_19737929616af586ecbff6d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳展鵬同陳楨怡非常曖昧！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447576309213702_16869704296af586f38444c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"11124.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447576309213702_16869704296af586f38444c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳楨怡為了幫忙復仇，按照計劃勾引陳展鵬（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447578757710357_10977425536af5870be084a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447578757710357_10977425536af5870be084a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傅嘉莉劇中揭發丈夫陳展鵬出軌，夫妻當面對質，場面火藥味十足！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794475793884253_7655386836af5871263afa.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-10\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794475793884253_7655386836af5871263afa.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳展鵬即刻質問「你結咗婚之後，你冇同其他男人過夜？」（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944758010941202_20766756946af58719720f2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944758010941202_20766756946af58719720f2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>無雙使計刺激菲雅的演戲欲，令她考慮接拍《玫瑰》。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447580760696126_12405424846af5872027d9c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-8\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447580760696126_12405424846af5872027d9c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>菲雅成功做到女主角（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447581663963263_12598346246af587291ce29.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-7\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447581663963263_12598346246af587291ce29.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:03:55.838390+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1221,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:45:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:37:51.798917+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:57:28.889442+00:00","content_hash":"80088bcfc55754140c06d3a6624f638217ecdb946ce7d4cf4dc5302e8dac48b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}